---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import BookingBand from '../components/BookingBand.astro';
import { COMPANY, FOUNDER } from '../config';
---
<Base title={`About: ${COMPANY}`}>
  <section class="band top">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow dot">About</p>
      <h1>Who you will be in the room with.</h1>
      <p class="lede">{COMPANY} is founder-led. The engineer on your first call is the one who designs and builds your automation.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="sec">
    <div class="wrap founder">
      <img src={FOUNDER.photo} alt={`${FOUNDER.name}, founder of ${COMPANY}`} width="800" height="1000" loading="eager" />
      <div class="bio">
        <p class="eyebrow dot">Founder</p>
        <h2>{FOUNDER.name}</h2>
        <p class="role">{FOUNDER.role}</p>
        {FOUNDER.linkedin && (
          <a class="li" href={FOUNDER.linkedin} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20.45 20.45h-3.56v-5.57c0-1.33-.02-3.04-1.85-3.04-1.85 0-2.14 1.45-2.14 2.94v5.67H9.34V9h3.42v1.56h.05c.48-.9 1.64-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.6 0 4.27 2.37 4.27 5.46v6.28zM5.34 7.43a2.06 2.06 0 1 1 0-4.13 2.06 2.06 0 0 1 0 4.13zM7.12 20.45H3.56V9h3.56v11.45zM22.22 0H1.77C.79 0 0 .77 0 1.73v20.54C0 23.23.79 24 1.77 24h20.45c.98 0 1.78-.77 1.78-1.73V1.73C24 .77 23.2 0 22.22 0z" /></svg>
            <span class="u">Connect on LinkedIn</span>
          </a>
        )}
        <p>A whole working life in technology, and today an AI engineer. {FOUNDER.name.split(' ')[0]} founded {COMPANY} to bring that engineering to staffing and recruiting firms, where sourcing, screening, follow-up and back-office work still take most of a consultant’s week.</p>
        <p>Every build starts from how your desk actually works and ends with a number you can check against the week before.</p>
        <div class="certs">
          <p class="caps">AI certifications</p>
          <ul>
            {FOUNDER.certs.map((c) => (
              <li class="card"><svg class="ic" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-shield" /></svg><b>{c}</b></li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <BookingBand />
</Base>

<style>
  .top{padding-block:96px 88px}
  .top .wrap{container-type:inline-size;display:grid;gap:22px;justify-items:start}
  h1{color:#fff;max-width:900px;font-size:clamp(34px,8cqi,60px);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.035em}
  .founder{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,5fr) minmax(0,7fr);gap:64px;align-items:center}
  img{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:4/5;object-fit:cover;border-radius:24px;background:var(--tint)}
  .bio{display:grid;gap:18px;justify-items:start}
  .role{margin-top:-8px;font-weight:700;color:var(--act)}
  .li{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink)}
  .li svg{width:20px;height:20px;fill:#0a66c2;flex:none}
  /* the label draws the nav links' accent underline on hover */
  .li .u{position:relative}
  .li .u::after{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:-4px;height:2px;background:var(--ac);transform:scaleX(0);transform-origin:left;transition:transform .4s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1);will-change:transform}
  @media (hover:hover){.li:hover .u::after{transform:scaleX(1)}}
  .bio > p:not(.eyebrow):not(.role){max-width:620px;font-size:17px}
  .certs{display:grid;gap:12px;width:100%;margin-top:10px}
  .certs ul{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px}
  .certs .card{display:flex;align-items:center;padding:16px 18px;gap:10px}
  .certs .ic{flex:none}
  .certs b{color:var(--ink);font-size:15px;line-height:1.3}
  @media (max-width:900px){
    .top{padding-block:72px 64px}
    .founder{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:40px}
    img{max-width:440px}
  }
  @media (max-width:560px){.certs ul{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}}
</style>
